    <worksheet name='Order Amount'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>KPI Card for Order Amount

3 calculated fields used:

1. CY Order Amount - Calculates the Order Amount based on Select Start Date and Select End Date parameter

2. PY Order Amount - Calculates the Order Amount based on Previous Start Date and Previous End Date calculations

2. Order Amount Variance - Calculates the variance/growth rate between CY Order Amount and PY Order Amount</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Sales Orders Sheet+ (Regional_Sales)' name='federated.0iy6olz0p8biwh124ppt11a0v3kg' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
